],"description":"## Context / Problem\nOn current `origin/main`, `infra/terraform-github/versions.tf` describes the Terraform provider path as equivalent to the shell fallback. They intentionally differ: `terraform-github/main.tf` locks only `main` so release tags remain available, while `apply-mirror-lock.sh` locks `main` and all tags. The comment hides a security/operations tradeoff.\n\n## Approach\nReplace the parity claim with a concise statement of the intentional tag-protection difference and point to the authoritative implementations.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] The comment accurately distinguishes main-only Terraform locking from shell main-and-tag locking.\n- [x] No Terraform value or executable behavior changes.\n- [x] Terraform format/validate and `make lint` pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/terraform-github/versions.tf","reason":"Correct the fallback-equivalence comment to preserve the intentional tag-protection difference."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","997f-8b13-d9fe-4c83"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"3f5d9936-aa94-4070-b053-fb69132e5ccd","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["terraform","github","documentation","drift"],"ticket_id":"9eab-ac4b-2c10-4fe1","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Correct terraform-github fallback parity comment for tag protection","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f58051ba-4c5f-4664-9a97-a9b6effec9ef","2d173d7f-37d5-4d23-9dd5-a5306798bde7","7583454f-7775-484f-be4a-99c441f4595c","1528899c-7145-4722-aa3b-f4f7f7b5192f","22ecd448-83c7-4747-b93f-22402ee83170","218ec902-86a3-4d7e-8381-ff482d27b3c1","d4bcb961-9278-44d0-b9df-8668d62f1498","bf7508e7-f95d-4c2a-b212-5aec702a69f3","019f4ae4-d27a-467b-8d2c-c7a88e75e4ef","84edfe4c-df8